The shared libraries installed by zlyme-armhf-runtime are the glibc and
GCC runtime produced by configs/zlyme_my355_armhf_defconfig with the
Buildroot version named in the runtime manifest. They are not imported
from another distribution.

glibc is LGPL-2.1-or-later, with some files GPL-2.0-or-later.
libgcc and libatomic are GPL-3.0-or-later WITH GCC-exception-3.1.

The corresponding source is the glibc and GCC source Buildroot downloads
for that version. The stage script in this directory is MIT:

